The event completion toggle should persist a user's completed/uncompleted intent and keep the selected-day UI in sync. The bug caused clicks on "Mark complete" to show transient saving states, 404 errors against older API processes, or rollbacks to "Mark complete" after background refreshes. A correct implementation needs consistent schema/API support for the completed flag, a fallback for older running servers, server-confirmed state transitions, and merge rules that prevent stale refresh responses from undoing newer completion saves.
